h - 0.15)\n  :timeout -> max(0.0, old_strength - 0.05)\nend"},{"id":"blk-45670","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51928","text":"Tests"}]},{"id":"blk-45671","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45673","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51929","text":"Successful outcome strengthens causal edge"}]}],"id":"blk-45672","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45675","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51930","text":"Failed outcome weakens causal edge"}]}],"id":"blk-45674","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45677","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51931","text":"causal_strength persists in edge metadata"}]}],"id":"blk-45676","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45679","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51932","text":"confounders field accepted and stored"}]}],"id":"blk-45678","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-45680","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51933","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-45681","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51934","text":"GraphMemBench Phase 3: Full Suite + Competitor Stubs (3 days)"}]},{"id":"blk-45682","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51935","text":"Add remaining 40 scenarios (Categories 11-15, 8 each)"}]},{"id":"blk-45683","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51936","marks":["bold"],"text":"Category 11: Causal Metadata (8 scenarios)"}]},{"id":"blk-45684","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45686","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51937","text":"causal_strength updates on outcome success"}]}],"id":"blk-45685","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45688","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51938","text":"causal_strength decreases on failure"}]}],"id":"blk-45687","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45690","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51939","text":"confounders stored in edge metadata"}]}],"id":"blk-45689","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-45692","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51940","text":"Causal subgraph extraction (al